                                "sense_id": "7f404d11-9dc7-38fd-ac8d-3b68e4a4e967",
                                "text": "[T]he plates of Queen's ware had not only been ill-used by being put upon the hob, by which they had lost some of their gadrooned-edges, but were of an unequal size, and the dishes were flat and therefore held little gravy."
